  SpeakerName: 'Ending D: Magic Space Program'
  DialogueText: You hold your palm out facing diagonally to the sky. A magic icicle
    forms in your palm, somehow not falling to the ground. A moment later, an explosion
    erupts from your palm, sending the icicle flying into the horizon, never to be
    seen again. It seems the boy really enjoyed your routine!
